# Force LF line endings on checkout across every platform.
#
# Without this, Windows runners checked out the skill-bundle test fixtures
# (references/notes.md, scripts/greet.sh, smithmark.yaml, and the golden JSON)
# with CRLF, which changed their sha256 digests and therefore the canonical
# bundle digest, failing every attest/verify/lint golden test on windows-latest
# while macOS and Linux passed. Golden files must be byte-identical across OSes;
# normalising to LF keeps the cross-OS determinism tests honest.
* text=auto eol=lf
